'''Horde of Cats''' (ネコたちの逆襲, ''Nekotachi no Gyakushū'', '''The Cats Strike Back''') is an event added in the [[Version 11.2 Update]]. Like all [[Gauntlet]]s, progress made in Horde of Cats will reset when the event ends. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]].

==Overview==
===About===
Horde of Cats contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). The reward for stages 1~5 is the [[Cat Units|Cat Unit]] [[Killer Cat (Enemy)|Killer Cat]], while rewards for stages 6~10 are Cat Tickets.

